# SECTION 9: Keeping the Grok and Codex windows open
# While `relay-protocol --serve` runs, ensure_agents() relaunches Grok or
# Codex whenever its window is missing, then hides it on the scratchpad.
# So if you close one of them it comes back within about 5-20 seconds.
# To stop that, stop the service:
#     systemctl --user stop relay-protocol.service
# To remove an agent from this, delete its entry in AGENT_COMMANDS.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

